  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 4.1% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $2.34B (4.1% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/tokenized-stock-holders-double-to-13m-as-activity-grows?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tokenized stock holders more than double as monthly volume surges</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/securitize-s-tokenized-assets-hit-4-3-billion-as-revenue-falls\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Securitize\u2019s Tokenized Assets Hit $4.3 Billion as Revenue Falls</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/375760/morning-minute-trump-to-meet-crypto-prediction-market-ceos-this-week\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Morning Minute: Trump To Meet Crypto, Prediction Market CEOs This Week</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/08/17/u-s-treasury-department-proposes-genius-act-stablecoin-rule\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">U.S. Treasury Department proposes GENIUS Act stablecoin rule</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
